# REFERENCE — verified on this machine on 2026-10-24
Node v20.20.1, npm 10.8.2, Docker 29.1.3. Working project: /home/electronica-care/ezy-prep/dryrun/app
Versions that worked: Next 16.4.3, React 19.3.0, Prisma 7.10.1, @prisma/client 7.10.1 (+ @prisma/adapter-pg 7.10.1, pg), @supabase/ssr 0.12.7, @supabase/supabase-js 2.118.0, supabase CLI 2.122.0, Vitest 4.1.12, shadcn 4.22.1 (style base-nova), Tailwind 4.3.3, ESLint 9.39.5, TS 5.9.3.
